MaD-RSI core implementation

This package contains the project's Model-as-Data algorithm components and
model-group evaluation logic. The core matrix, selection, acquisition, evidence,
and optional acceptance functions were extracted and refactored from the
project's RRSI-based implementation. Public input validation and an optimizer
interface were added for independent use.

No third-party RRSI engine source is vendored in this distribution. Integrators
must obtain their chosen optimizer separately and comply with its license.
